  "changelog": "- New Pomodoro action: work / short break / long break every N sessions, configurable lengths,\n  the completed-session count on the key, press to start / pause, optional auto-start of the next\n  phase; a new Pomodoro Skip / Reset action skips or resets the Pomodoro with the same name.\n- Countdown Timer can write the time left to a text file every second (for an OBS text source):\n  path, format (mm:ss, h:mm:ss, hh:mm:ss) and text at zero in its settings.",
